      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Me? Strange—?\r\nFufufufu, nothing strange here.\r\nLook, there's no doubt that I'm Shelly.",
        "Jp" : "ワタシガ、ヘン――？\r\nフフフフフ、オカシナコトヲ――イウノネェ\r\nホラ、マチガイナクしぇりーヨ"
