      "Jp" : "シェリー"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 27116,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Look! You see!? She's acting odd, isn't she? \r\nI beg you, find out what's going on with her!\r\nIf she continues to be like this,\r\nwe won't have Halloween this year!",
        "Jp" : "ほら！　な！？\r\nやっぱり様子がおかしいだろう\r\n頼む、彼女に何がおこったのか調べてくれ！\r\nこのままでは今年のハロウィンは中止だぁ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 679423,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Come to think of it, I heard on the way here\r\nabout something called the [Ghost Lantern].\r\nThey say it holds a mysterious power that reveals\r\nthe true forms of things when held aloft.",
        "Jp" : "そういえば、ここに来る途中に聞いたんだが\r\n《ゴーストランタン》というものがあるらしい\r\nかざすと真実の姿を照らし出すという\r\n不思議な力をもったランタンだそうだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 679424,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Can't we somehow obtain it?\r\nLet's see, the usual one!\r\nThat fellow who trades anything!\r\nGo see if he knows anything about it.",
        "Jp" : "それを何とかして入手できないだろうか――\r\nえーっと、いつもの！\r\n何でも交換してくれる彼！\r\n彼のところで調べてきてくれ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 679425,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4714,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Angelo",
      "Jp" : "アンジェロ"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 27117,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well, well, Arisen.\r\nWhat brings you here in such a hurry?",
        "Jp" : "おやおや、覚者さん\r\nずいぶん急いでどうなさいました\r\n――本日はどのようなご用件で？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 679426,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I see, the [Ghost Lantern], is it?\r\nYes, such a thing does exist—\r\nIndeed, it does.",
        "Jp" : "なるほど、《ゴーストランタン》でございますか\r\n――あることにはありますよ、ええ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 679427,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "This here is a bit of \"cursed\" item, so I don't \r\nput it on display. Heh heh, but since it's \r\nyour request, Ser, I will allow it. \r\nShall we proceed with a trade?",
        "Jp" : "こちら少々\"いわく付き\"の品なので\r\nあまり表には出していないのですがね――\r\nへっへへ、他ならぬ覚者さんの頼みですからねぇ\r\nええ、交換とさせていただきましょうか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 679428,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Well, even for you, Ser, I can't just give \r\nthis away for free. Bring me something of \r\nequal value, and I shall part with it— \r\nheh heh.",
        "Jp" : "そりゃ、いくら覚者さんといえど\r\nタダで差し上げるわけにはいきませんよ\r\n相応の品をお持ち下されば\r\nその対価としてお譲りいたしますとも――へへ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 682147,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The item you need to bring me is— \r\nlet's see, how about some \r\n[Ghost Marshmallows], which can \r\nonly be obtained now? I hear they \r\ncan be found by defeating monsters.",
        "Jp" : "持ってきていただく品物は――\r\nそうですね、今しか手に入らない\r\n《おばけマシュマロ》でいかがです\r\nなんでも、魔物を倒すと手に入るそうで"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 692185,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 4706,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Gregory",
      "Jp" : "グレゴリー"
    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 27141,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Oh, it suits you very well— \r\nhowever, as I mentioned before, \r\nthat lantern carries a bit of a \r\n\"reputation.\" So do take care when \r\nusing it to illuminate anything suspicious.",
        "Jp" : "おお、とてもよくお似合いで――\r\nただし、以前にも申しました通り\r\nそのランタンは多少\"いわく付き\"の品でして\r\nあやしげなものを照らす際には、ご注意を"
