      "GmdIndex" : 20,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I saw a woman go into that well, but \r\nit's too dark to see anything. \r\nYou'd best take something bright \r\nto illuminate the area if you plan \r\nto look around there.",
        "Jp" : "そこの井戸に女性が入っていくのを見たけど\r\n暗くて何も見えないから、\r\n何か明るく照らすものをもって行った方がいい"
