      "GmdIndex" : 21,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Wh-What? You came all the way \r\nto a place like this to ask me \r\nsomething? What is it you seek?",
        "Jp" : "ナ、ナアニ？　コンナトコロマデ――\r\nワタシニ、ナニカヨウ？"
