      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 22,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "There's nothing strange here, \r\nI promise. You believe me, \r\ndon't you? I'm telling the truth.",
        "Jp" : "ココニハ、アヤシイモノナンテ\r\nナニモナイワ\r\n――シンジテクレルワヨネ？"
